        "translator": "K. M. K. Murthy / Desiraju Hanumanta Rao",
        "text": "\"Rama was united indeed with the Vanara Hanuma on the banks of Lake Pampa, and upon the word of Hanuma, Rama met with Sugreeva... [1-1-58b, 59b]"
